@* The panel for a person that does not exist or is not the signed-in user's. The two look exactly
   the same on purpose, so a link can never be used to find out whether someone else's person
   exists. Shared by the profile and the edit page. *@
@inject NavigationManager Navigation

<div data-testid="person-not-found">
    <EmptyState Title="This person isn't in your list"
                Message="The link may be wrong, or they were removed."
                ActionLabel="Back to people"
                OnAction="BackToPeople" />
</div>

@code {
    private void BackToPeople() => Navigation.NavigateTo("/people");
}
